{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026uWnKqd9Czd1794786622.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>烏克蘭總統澤連斯基稱，烏軍使用的「星盾」衛星通信系統被限速，阻礙攔截俄羅斯無人機的能力，呼籲美國解除限制。</p><p></p><p>澤連斯基周日表示，星盾運作太慢，影響烏軍攔截俄軍無人機的能力，並會削弱冬季來臨前，烏軍對能源基礎設施的防護，因此需要美方解除限制。</p><p></p><p>他指示烏方官員，跟美國政府及「星盾」所屬的太空探索公司SpaceX保持緊密合作，指站在歷史正確一方至關重要。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T00:49:43.781523+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T23:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T02:20:03.189177+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T00:43:04.841204+00:00","content_hash":"96a3e7907d146dfc6181d07f828c5e201ba64922aa3b233e692059fb1d2f42b7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T00:49:43.781523+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}